<title>TAIWAN: Taiwan one-month NCD average yield at 7.513 pct.</title>
<headline>Taiwan one-month NCD average yield at 7.513 pct.</headline>
<dateline>TAIPEI 1997-07-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Taiwan's central bank issued T$5 billion in one-month negotiable certificates of deposit on Wednesday at an average yield of 7.513 percent, a central bank official said.</p>
<p>The range of the bids was between 7.475 and 7.600 percent.</p>
<p>Demand totalled T$6.8 billion.</p>
<p>The issue coincides with a long bull run in Taiwan's stock market, where the index has pushed to a series of seven-year highs in recent weeks.</p>
<p>--Taipei newsroom (886-2-508-0815)</p>
